      "cooked": "<p>In CRM Lead, the notes is a child table, but it’s rendered as shown below, how can I customize the child table to render like that</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 083559\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0_2_690x147.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 083559\" data-base62-sha1=\"cQTrKKyuTVFe9UWWJiZ4iCzPr0s\" width=\"690\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0_2_690x147.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0_2_1035x220.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5a14c23a09733fd1d2e2d98792d4bc17dc1a29e0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-01-06 083559</span><span class=\"informations\">1276×273 18 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
