      "id": 490449,
      "username": "Ayesha_F",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2026-01-07T06:10:41.310Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To implement a similar behaviour:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Use Client Script</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add an HTML field in your desired doctype</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fetch child table data using frappe.call</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Render the desired HTML elements using <strong>frappe.render_template</strong> into the HTML field</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>To Handle <strong>edit actions</strong> use <strong>jQuery</strong> and sync changes back to the child table</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To understand how this is implemented internally in ERPNext, refer to: erpnext/public/js/utils/crm_activities.js and lead.js file</p>\n<p>These files handles custom rendering of CRM activities (including notes) and serves as a good reference for replicating the same pattern.</p>",
